  "title": "Board temperature limit test results",
  "content": "<p>Hello Gyessine,</p><p> </p><p>We tested the board in chamber, it seems that it can only work @105℃, even we decrease the CPU clock to 40MHz, if CPU clock is 200MHz, it only can work @95℃.</p><p> </p><p>We are using seperate LDO for 1.2V Core, you can check the circuit below.</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/d40da2bb-bc90-4446-b2ed-c578aa5ebdfb.png\" /></figure><p> </p>",
